<title>USA: Toyota November US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Toyota November US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    48,502	    39,799	    +21.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  11,964	    10,583	    +13.0</p>
<p> Import Car		18,716	    20,502	     -8.7</p>
<p> Import Truck	    20,059	    12,100	    +65.8</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   518,790	   452,518	    +13.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 132,620	    99,979	    +31.7</p>
<p> Import Car	     221,146	   268,193	    -18.1</p>
<p> Import Truck	   205,115	   163,286	    +24.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
</text>
